      "text": "Let me tell you where I've got to. I don't have a clear answer today: symptoms that suggest obstructive sleep apnoea is possible, and so is an under-active thyroid. Let's book a thyroid test to look into tiredness. An overnight sleep study is what I'd like next, for suspected sleep apnoea. Try to sleep on your side and avoid alcohol close to bedtime."
